@startuml SEQ_05_MELIHAT_RIWAYAT_KEUANGAN
!theme plain
skinparam defaultFontSize 12
skinparam TitleFontSize 14
title Sequence Diagram — SEQ-05: Melihat Riwayat Keuangan

actor       "Asisten / Dosen / Kadep"  as Actor
boundary    "Browser"                  as Browser
control     "RiwayatKeuanganController" as Controller
entity      "RiwayatKeuangan Model"    as Model
entity      "NominalKas Model"         as ModelKas

== Lihat Riwayat ==

Actor   -> Browser     : Buka menu riwayat

Browser -> Controller  : GET /riwayat-keuangan

Controller -> Model    : Query transaksi
Model --> Controller : Hasil query
Controller -> ModelKas : Query nominal kas
ModelKas --> Controller : Hasil proses
Controller --> Browser : Render halaman
Browser --> Actor      : Tampil transaksi & saldo

== Lihat Detail ==

Actor   -> Browser     : Klik transaksi

Browser -> Controller  : GET /riwayat-keuangan/{id}

Controller -> Model    : Query detail
Model --> Controller : Hasil proses
Controller --> Browser : Render detail
Browser --> Actor      : Tampil detail transaksi

@enduml